+## V2 Billing Workflow
+- New bill uses three save boundaries: patient registration/selection, persisted visit, then billing.
+- `prepared_visit_id` is `visitlog.id`, the database primary key; `visitlog.visit_id` is a separate sequence number.
+- V2 workflow routes validate hospital, patient, doctor and visit ownership before invoking the shared billing engine. Keep legacy callers on their existing behavior when no prepared visit is supplied.
+- Do not load `registration-engine.js` alongside `opd-billing.js`; both bind shared component IDs and have separate state. Inline billing registration is handled by `billing-patient.js`.
